        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-indigo-100 mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          MRI reports can look scary, but remember: <strong
            >many common findings are normal parts of aging</strong
          > and don't require treatment. The most important thing is <strong
            >correlation with your symptoms</strong
          >. Always discuss your results with your doctor, who can put
          everything in context and create a personalized treatment plan.
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto">
